flowchart LR
  subgraph IN[What the app reads today]
    CI[Check-in after a session<br/>performance · effort · pain + area]
    LOG[Strength logs<br/>sets · reps · weight · RPE]
    RID[Rides<br/>time · distance · avg HR · power unverified]
    PRO[Profile<br/>mode · priority · level · goals<br/>recovery capacity · age · health check]
    AV[Availability + budgets]
    EQ[Equipment · exclusions · preferences]
    AH[Apple Health<br/>sleep · resting HR · HRV]
  end
  subgraph ENG[Seven separate rule engines]
    E1[1 Week builder<br/>PlanEngine]
    E2[2 Strength planner<br/>StrengthPlanner]
    E3[3 Adaptive coach<br/>AdaptationEngine]
    E4[4 Hybrid coach<br/>HybridCoach]
    E5[5 Session validator<br/>WorkoutValidator]
    E6[6 Recovery advice<br/>RecoveryAnalysis]
    E7[7 Live ride cues<br/>CoachCore]
  end
  PLAN[(Plan<br/>next 2 weeks)]
  TXT[Text only<br/>no plan change]
  PRO --> E1 & E2
  AV --> E1
  EQ --> E2
  LOG --> E2 & E3 & E4
  CI --> E3
  CI -. fatigue · pain .-> E2
  RID --> E3 & E4
  E1 -->|generates| PLAN
  E2 -->|fills and rebuilds strength sessions<br/>increases apply with no approval| PLAN
  E3 -->|automatic changes when auto-adapt is on<br/>proposals for large changes| PLAN
  E4 -->|proposals, athlete taps Apply| PLAN
  E5 -->|blocks or allows an edit| PLAN
  AH --> E6 --> TXT
  RID --> E7 --> TXT
